      "content": "but idk, the \"support\" part just feels like more people watching me fail. like, even if they mean well, i'll always just be the guy who lost it all. it's the descent that's killing me. every day it's just another step deeper into being nothing. i'd rather just have it be over than have to live through the embarrassment of the actual crash.",
